# Gate step 1254-fdsu — measurement producers emit a DOT decimal under a comma
# locale. The fixture injects one chosen by measurement (a GNU-awk-only PATH
# shim adds --use-lc-numeric; BSD awk honours LC_NUMERIC natively) and has a
# mutation arm per producer that strips the LC_ALL=C pins and must go red.
#
# STEP_SCRIPT is a LITERAL path on purpose (1063-nraf).
STEP_DESC="Checking measurement producers emit dot decimals under a comma locale (1254-fdsu)"
STEP_SCRIPT="scripts/test-awk-float-lc-numeric.sh"
STEP_ERROR="a measurement producer emits a comma decimal under a comma locale, or a mutation arm went vacuous (1254-fdsu) — see the verdict line above"
STEP_OK="Measurement producers emit dot decimals under a comma locale"
